; W5 Wave6 Slice B: bounded domain/schema/AI orchestration.
; This is a static :meta consumer of supplied manifests.  It never contacts a
; model provider, opens a database, executes a tool, or grants ambient host
; authority.  Its accepted result is an incomplete, non-authoritative record.
(ns gravity.self-hosting.w5-domain-schema-ai-executor
  (:profile :meta)
  (:target :jvm)
  (:exports [w5-domain-schema-ai-policy
             w5-domain-schema-ai-domain-manifest
             w5-domain-schema-ai-schema-manifest
             w5-domain-schema-ai-diagnostic-catalog
             w5-domain-schema-ai-source-span
             w5-domain-schema-ai-domain-valid?
